      <p>Follow Him Scripture Shorts is a personal tool used solely by its owner, Cody Maughan, to publish videos to channels he owns. It is not offered as a service to anyone else, and no one else may sign in to or use it.</p>
      <p>By using YouTube features through this tool, the user agrees to be bound by the <a class="text-primary hover:underline" href="https://www.youtube.com/t/terms">YouTube Terms of Service</a>. Use of X features is subject to the <a class="text-primary hover:underline" href="https://x.com/tos">X Terms of Service</a>.</p>
      <p>The tool is provided as-is, without warranty of any kind. See the <a class="text-primary hover:underline" href="/follow-him-scripture-shorts/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> for how data is handled.</p>
      <p>Contact: <a class="text-primary hover:underline" href="mailto:followhimscriptureshorts@gmail.com">followhimscriptureshorts@gmail.com</a></p>
